---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';

import {site} from '../config/site';
---
<Layout title="Website terms" description={`A clear understanding. Read the ${site.shortName} demonstration website’s website terms.`}><PageIntro title="A clear understanding." eyebrow="Website terms" items={[{name:'Website terms'}]}/><section class="section container" style="padding-top:0"><div class="rich-copy"><h2>About this website</h2><p>{site.name} is a fictional demonstration practice. The website, clinician profiles, prices, testimonials and appointment availability illustrate a design and booking experience. They do not establish an operating clinic or a clinician-patient relationship.</p><h2>Information & clinical decisions</h2><p>Content is educational and general. It is not a diagnosis, prescription or individual treatment plan. A qualified professional must assess suitability, explain risks and obtain consent before any clinical procedure.</p><h2>Requests & payments</h2><p>Submitting a form creates an inquiry, not a confirmed appointment, treatment contract, membership or purchase. This website does not collect payment. A live provider would confirm availability, fees and applicable terms separately.</p><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Use the website lawfully. Do not submit malicious code, impersonate another person, interfere with service or send unsolicited advertising through forms. Automated abuse may be rate limited.</p><h2>Creative materials & external links</h2><p>Original design and copy belong to the project owner. Stock assets remain subject to their respective licenses listed in CREDITS.md. External websites are independently operated; a link does not guarantee their content or availability.</p><h2>Service limitations</h2><p>This demonstration is provided as available and may contain errors. Nothing in these sample terms limits rights that cannot legally be excluded. A live operator must review and replace these terms before launch.</p><p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href="/contact">Contact the team ↗</a></p></div></section></Layout>
